[[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the engine oil cooling radiator\nair duct (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069235.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the engine oil cooling radiator air\nduct in its seating and secure it with its bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <strong>- 7055B91 Right front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237449\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237870\">1084C34</a>\n                                           .</p><p>At the bench, undo the bolts and separate\nthe air duct for the engine oil cooling radiator from the radiator.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>At the bench, assemble the air duct for\nengine oil cooling radiator to the radiator and tighten the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237870\">1084C34</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237449\">1008B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <strong>- 7055B91 Right front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <strong>- 0010T11 engine oil check level and top up</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]